# Project language is English

Every artifact in this repository must be in **English**:

- Source code and identifiers (no comments in source — `no-comments.mdc`)
- Tests and assertion messages
- Docs (`docs/`, `AGENTS.md`, skills, ADRs)
- Cursor rules (`.cursor/rules/`) and the Claude Code bridge (`CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/`)
- Commit messages and PR descriptions
- Env example comments, Docker comments, and CI config
- User-visible UI copy, unless `docs/product.md` sets a different UI language

Do not add Portuguese (or any other language) to the repo. When editing a file that is still in another language, rewrite the touched file in English in the same change.

Chat with the human may follow the human's language. That does not apply to files in the repository.
